msgid "Clear WP Rocket caches from Minn and monitor its license alongside other paid components. Download the plugin .zip from WP Rocket."
msgstr "Limpe os caches do WP Rocket pelo Minn e monitore a licença dele junto com outros componentes pagos. Baixe o arquivo .zip do plugin no WP Rocket."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:9763
